			<div class="text animate slideUp fade interval">
				<h1>Government AI Readiness Index <strong>2025</strong></h1>
				<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The 2025 edition is here! We remain dedicated to providing valuable insights at the intersection of government and AI. This year, our leading AI index assesses 195 governments worldwide by their capacity to harness AI to benefit the public.</span></p>
				<a href="#summary" class="btn outlineBtn">Explore the index</a>
			</div>


			
